# CharArchive image-analysis model
#
# Ollama's published qwen2.5vl pins its context window to 4096 tokens. An
# image costs roughly (width / 28) * (height / 28) tokens, so a single 2K
# photo needs over 4000 tokens before the app's request schema is even
# counted. Uploads therefore failed with HTTP 400 "exceeds the available
# context size".
#
# Requesting num_ctx per call does not help, because the Modelfile parameter
# wins. Deriving a model with a wider window is the fix. It reuses the same
# weight blobs, so this costs no extra disk space.
#
# Create it with: npm run model:setup
FROM qwen2.5vl:7b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768